@startuml sequence-4-service
!include style.iuml
title Restaurant Rush | Turns 7-18: READY, SERVED, payment and result (sequence 4 of 4)
caption Expands the winning run. Calls for other customers are omitted here; page 1 retains the full-game loop.
boundary "ui : ConsoleUI" as UI
control "controller : TurnController" as TC
entity "state : GameState" as State
participant "c3 : RegularCustomer" as C3
entity "o3 : Order" as O3
participant "chef : Chef" as Chef
participant "waiter : Waiter" as Waiter
participant "cashier : Cashier" as Cashier
entity "t1 : Table" as T1
autonumber

UI -> TC : endTurn() [turn 7]
TC -> Cashier : collect(state)
note right of Cashier : C2 pays this turn; no C3 payment yet.
TC -> C3 : isWaitingForTableOrFood(); loseSatisfaction()
C3 --> TC : true; 92
TC --> UI : TurnEnd; TURN_START

UI -> TC : beginTurn(false) [turn 8]
TC -> State : setTurn(8); happyHourActive()
State --> TC : true; remaining 1
TC -> C3 : recover(15)
C3 --> TC : 100 (actual recovery 8)
TC --> UI : TurnStart; "C3 recovers 8 satisfaction (100)"
loop turns 8 and 9: Host WAIT, Waiter WAIT, Chef PREPARE O3
  opt turn 9
    UI -> TC : beginTurn(false)
    TC --> UI : TurnStart; remaining 0, no recovery
  end
  note over UI, TC
    At turn 9: beginTurn(false) has remaining 0, so no recovery.
    WAIT is handled in dispatch: no Host/Waiter method call.
  end note
  UI -> TC : submit(Action(HOST, WAIT, null))
  TC --> UI : accepted; phase WAITER
  UI -> TC : submit(Action(WAITER, WAIT, null))
  TC --> UI : accepted; phase CHEF
  UI -> TC : submit(Action(CHEF, PREPARE, "O3"))
  TC -> Chef : prepare(state, "O3")
  Chef -> O3 : advanceOneUnit(turn)
  alt turn 8
    note right of O3 : PREPARING, 2/3 units.
  else turn 9
    note right of O3 : READY, 3/3 units; readyTurn = 9.
  end
  Chef --> TC : accepted; progress or READY event
  TC --> UI : ActionResult; phase TURN_END
  UI -> TC : endTurn()
  TC -> Cashier : collect(state)
  TC -> C3 : loseSatisfaction()
  C3 --> TC : 92 after turn 8; 84 after turn 9
  TC --> UI : TurnEnd
end

UI -> TC : beginTurn(false) [turn 10]
note over UI, Waiter : Host seats C4 at T2 before the Waiter action; C3 still occupies T1.
UI -> TC : submit(Action(HOST, SEAT, "C4"))
TC --> UI : accepted; phase WAITER (seating pattern from page 2)
UI -> TC : submit(Action(WAITER, SERVE, "O3"))
TC -> Waiter : serve(state, "O3")
Waiter -> O3 : status(); readyTurn()
O3 --> Waiter : READY; 9 < current turn 10
Waiter -> C3 : startEating(10)
Waiter -> O3 : markServed(10)
Waiter -> State : recordServed()
Waiter --> TC : accepted; "O3 served to C3"
TC --> UI : ActionResult
UI -> TC : submit(Action(CHEF, WAIT, null))
TC --> UI : accepted; phase TURN_END
UI -> TC : endTurn() [after Chef WAIT on turn 10]
note right of TC
  C3 servedTurn == current turn, so still EATING.
  No waiting loss after serving; satisfaction stays 84.
end note
TC -> Cashier : collect(state)
TC --> UI : TurnEnd

UI -> TC : beginTurn(false) [turn 11]
note over UI, TC : Fixture: Host WAIT; ORDER C4; PREPARE O4, then endTurn.
UI -> TC : endTurn()
TC -> C3 : becomeReadyToPay(11) [EATING and servedTurn < 11]
note right of C3 : READY_TO_PAY; readyToPayTurn = 11; satisfaction 84.
TC -> Cashier : collect(state)
note right of Cashier : Guard is readyToPayTurn < current turn: C3 cannot pay on 11.
TC --> UI : TurnEnd; "C3 is ready to pay"

UI -> TC : beginTurn(false) [turn 12]
note over UI, TC : Fixture: Host WAIT; Waiter WAIT; PREPARE O4, then endTurn.
UI -> TC : endTurn()
TC -> Cashier : collect(state)
Cashier -> State : customers()
note right of Cashier
  Oldest eligible READY_TO_PAY: C3, readyToPayTurn 11 < 12.
  Tie-breaks: readyToPayTurn, arrivalTurn, arrivalIndex.
end note
Cashier -> C3 : order()
C3 --> Cashier : o3
Cashier -> State : tableOf("C3")
State --> Cashier : t1
Cashier -> O3 : markPaid()
Cashier -> C3 : pay()
Cashier -> T1 : release()
Cashier -> State : recordPayment(1944, 84)
Cashier --> TC : event "C3 paid $19.44 (satisfaction 84), T1 free"
TC --> UI : TurnEnd (cumulative revenue 4194, paidCount 3)

ref over UI, TC : Continue page 1's fixture loop: C4 pays on 15, C5 on 17; all turns complete.
UI -> TC : endTurn() [turn 18, after all three staff choices]
TC -> TC : isVictory()
note right of TC
  paidCount 5 >= 4; revenueCents 7494 >= 4500;
  satisfactionSum 419 >= 60 * 5. Result: VICTORY.
  In page 1's all-WAIT branch: paid/revenue/sum = 0 -> DEFEAT.
end note
TC -> State : setPhase(GAME_OVER)
TC --> UI : TurnEnd(summary, Optional.of(VICTORY))
UI --> UI : render(summary, result)

legend bottom left
  Call annotations in [brackets] are guards/context, not extra parameters.
  Page 1 supplies repeated beginTurn/staff/endTurn calls omitted by ref/notes here.
  Strict delays: ready on 9 -> served on 10 -> ready-to-pay on 11 -> paid on 12.
endlegend
footer O3 bill stays 1944 after Happy Hour expires; T1 is released only at turn-12 payment.
@enduml
